Not done with me yet?

She silently slides the sketchbook away, pressing herself deeper into the shadows. Her fingers trace the rough texture of the wall, finding purchase on a hidden panel.


The heavy boots of enforcers grow louder, accompanied by the electric hum of their visors.

ENFORCER 2 (O.S.)
