The gentle HUM of old servers provides a comforting white noise as she finally allows her muscles to relax, though her eyes remain alert, scanning the multiple security feeds she's hacked into.

PHOENIX
(softly)

One more day of freedom. One more piece of art they couldn't destroy.

Her freckles pulse once more before dimming to a soft glow, matching the peaceful atmosphere of her hidden refuge.


Phoenix's fingers trace the luminescent patterns on the wall, her freckles glowing in harmony with the ethereal light show. The refracted rainbows dance across her face as she takes in the magnitude of this hidden sanctuary.

